1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,316
Five things you must never do in Cuba.

2
00:00:04,700 --> 00:00:07,434
Don't photograph soldiers or police. It's against the law.

3
00:00:08,484 --> 00:00:10,676
Don't count on your bank card. Bring cash.

4
00:00:11,726 --> 00:00:13,966
Don't change money on the street. It's illegal.

5
00:00:15,016 --> 00:00:17,308
Don't pack a drone. Customs will take it.

6
00:00:18,358 --> 00:00:23,388
And don't buy black market beef. Killing a cow without permission can mean years in prison.
